      {
        "name": "logo-assembly",
        "value": "1500ms",
        "purpose": "Four portions of the supplied X settle into the intact source artwork."
      },
      {
        "name": "logo-random-dust",
        "value": "progress .12–.56; dust 1300ms; glitter 4200ms",
        "purpose": "The clean supplied X hands off to source-coloured points that release in irregular random groups, becoming luminous, independently scattered grains with varied direction, speed and depth. A separate sparse glint pass has independently phased bright stars with clear cores and tapered rays, using the same source origins and trajectories with its own finite afterglow. A shared smooth fragment field controls release; reduced motion, pause and graphics failure keep the native image."
